+1. Land the one-line diff on core main.
+2. `workflow_dispatch` the `ci` workflow with `run_autofix=true` → expect `autofix` green with the upload step skipped (expression false on private repo).
+3. Next nightly schedule fire → expect green; expect NO new federation mirror row on the open board.
+4. Rollback: revert the one line (single-commit revert, no interactions).
